{
  "name": "Helped - Telegram Broadcast",
  "flow": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "module": "gateway:CustomWebHook",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": { "hook": 0, "maxResults": 1 },
      "mapper": {},
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "restore": { "parameters": { "hook": { "data": { "editable": "true" }, "label": "Helped Telegram Broadcast" } } },
        "notes": "Create an instant custom webhook and set its URL as Worker secret MAKE_TELEGRAM_BROADCAST_WEBHOOK_URL. The Worker supplies only active, consented Telegram subscribers."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "module": "builtin:BasicFeeder",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": { "array": "{{1.recipients}}" },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 300, "y": 0 },
        "restore": {},
        "expect": [{ "name": "array", "type": "array", "label": "Registered Telegram recipients", "spec": [
          { "name": "telegram_chat_id", "type": "text", "label": "Telegram chat ID" },
          { "name": "applicant_id", "type": "text", "label": "Verified applicant reference (optional)" },
          { "name": "first_name", "type": "text", "label": "First name" },
          { "name": "language_code", "type": "text", "label": "Telegram language code" }
        ] }],
        "notes": "Never add phone-number imports or other recipients here."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "module": "builtin:BasicRouter",
      "version": 1,
      "mapper": null,
      "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 600, "y": 0, "name": "Send text or attachment" } },
      "routes": [
        { "flow": [
          { "id": 4, "module": "http:ActionSendData", "version": 3, "filter": { "name": "Text only", "conditions": [[{ "a": "{{ifempty(1.mediaType; \"text\")}}", "o": "text:equal", "b": "text" }]] }, "parameters": { "handleErrors": true, "useNewZLIB": true }, "mapper": { "url": "https://api.telegram.org/botREPLACE_WITH_BOT_TOKEN/sendMessage", "serializeUrl": false, "method": "post", "headers": [], "qs": [], "bodyType": "raw", "parseResponse": true, "rejectUnauthorized": true, "followRedirect": true, "gzip": true, "contentType": "application/json", "data": "{\n  \"chat_id\": \"{{2.telegram_chat_id}}\",\n  \"text\": \"{{escapeJSON(1.message)}}\",\n  \"disable_web_page_preview\": false\n}" }, "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 900, "y": -180 }, "restore": {}, "notes": "Replace the token placeholder with a protected Make secret or connection." } },
          { "id": 5, "module": "http:ActionSendData", "version": 3, "parameters": { "handleErrors": true, "useNewZLIB": true }, "mapper": { "url": "https://YOUR-DOMAIN/api/telegram/automation/delivery-result", "serializeUrl": false, "method": "post", "headers": [{ "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "name": "x-telegram-automation-secret", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_TELEGRAM_AUTOMATION_SECRET" }], "qs": [], "bodyType": "raw", "parseResponse": true, "rejectUnauthorized": true, "followRedirect": true, "gzip": true, "contentType": "application/json", "data": "{\n  \"broadcastId\": \"{{1.broadcastId}}\",\n  \"chatId\": \"{{2.telegram_chat_id}}\",\n  \"status\": \"sent\",\n  \"messageId\": \"{{4.data.result.message_id}}\"\n}" }, "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 1200, "y": -180 }, "restore": {}, "notes": "Write success to the website after Telegram accepts the message." } }
        ] },
        { "flow": [
          { "id": 6, "module": "http:ActionSendData", "version": 3, "filter": { "name": "Image", "conditions": [[{ "a": "{{1.mediaType}}", "o": "text:equal", "b": "image" }]] }, "parameters": { "handleErrors": true, "useNewZLIB": true }, "mapper": { "url": "https://api.telegram.org/botREPLACE_WITH_BOT_TOKEN/sendPhoto", "serializeUrl": false, "method": "post", "headers": [], "qs": [], "bodyType": "raw", "parseResponse": true, "rejectUnauthorized": true, "followRedirect": true, "gzip": true, "contentType": "application/json", "data": "{\n  \"chat_id\": \"{{2.telegram_chat_id}}\",\n  \"photo\": \"{{1.mediaUrl}}\",\n  \"caption\": \"{{escapeJSON(1.message)}}\"\n}" }, "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 900, "y": 0 }, "restore": {}, "notes": "Telegram fetches the public, unguessable R2 media URL." } },
          { "id": 7, "module": "http:ActionSendData", "version": 3, "parameters": { "handleErrors": true, "useNewZLIB": true }, "mapper": { "url": "https://YOUR-DOMAIN/api/telegram/automation/delivery-result", "serializeUrl": false, "method": "post", "headers": [{ "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "name": "x-telegram-automation-secret", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_TELEGRAM_AUTOMATION_SECRET" }], "qs": [], "bodyType": "raw", "parseResponse": true, "rejectUnauthorized": true, "followRedirect": true, "gzip": true, "contentType": "application/json", "data": "{\n  \"broadcastId\": \"{{1.broadcastId}}\",\n  \"chatId\": \"{{2.telegram_chat_id}}\",\n  \"status\": \"sent\",\n  \"messageId\": \"{{6.data.result.message_id}}\"\n}" }, "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 1200, "y": 0 }, "restore": {}, "notes": "Write success to the website after Telegram accepts the image." } }
        ] },
        { "flow": [
          { "id": 8, "module": "http:ActionSendData", "version": 3, "filter": { "name": "Document", "conditions": [[{ "a": "{{1.mediaType}}", "o": "text:equal", "b": "document" }]] }, "parameters": { "handleErrors": true, "useNewZLIB": true }, "mapper": { "url": "https://api.telegram.org/botREPLACE_WITH_BOT_TOKEN/sendDocument", "serializeUrl": false, "method": "post", "headers": [], "qs": [], "bodyType": "raw", "parseResponse": true, "rejectUnauthorized": true, "followRedirect": true, "gzip": true, "contentType": "application/json", "data": "{\n  \"chat_id\": \"{{2.telegram_chat_id}}\",\n  \"document\": \"{{1.mediaUrl}}\",\n  \"caption\": \"{{escapeJSON(1.message)}}\"\n}" }, "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 900, "y": 180 }, "restore": {}, "notes": "Telegram fetches the public, unguessable R2 media URL." } },
          { "id": 9, "module": "http:ActionSendData", "version": 3, "parameters": { "handleErrors": true, "useNewZLIB": true }, "mapper": { "url": "https://YOUR-DOMAIN/api/telegram/automation/delivery-result", "serializeUrl": false, "method": "post", "headers": [{ "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "name": "x-telegram-automation-secret", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_TELEGRAM_AUTOMATION_SECRET" }], "qs": [], "bodyType": "raw", "parseResponse": true, "rejectUnauthorized": true, "followRedirect": true, "gzip": true, "contentType": "application/json", "data": "{\n  \"broadcastId\": \"{{1.broadcastId}}\",\n  \"chatId\": \"{{2.telegram_chat_id}}\",\n  \"status\": \"sent\",\n  \"messageId\": \"{{8.data.result.message_id}}\"\n}" }, "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 1200, "y": 180 }, "restore": {}, "notes": "Write success to the website after Telegram accepts the document." } }
        ] }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "instant": true,
    "version": 1,
    "scenario": { "roundtrips": 1, "maxErrors": 10, "autoCommit": true, "autoCommitTriggerLast": true, "sequential": true, "confidential": true, "dataloss": false, "dlq": false },
    "designer": { "orphans": [] },
    "zone": "eu1.make.com",
    "notes": [
      "Helped - Telegram Broadcast.",
      "Create the Custom Webhook after import, replace YOUR-DOMAIN and secret placeholders, protect the Bot API token in Make, then activate the scenario.",
      "The router includes text, image, and document branches. Start with one test subscriber and verify each route before using attachments.",
      "Configure bounded backoff for Telegram 429 responses and an error-handler callback that reports definitive failures to /api/telegram/automation/delivery-result before sending to a large audience. Do not automatically resend an ambiguous timeout because Telegram may already have accepted it."
    ]
  }
}
